#: includes/class-atshift-upf-admin.php
msgid "Applied when a new user is added."
msgstr "Se aplica al añadir un nuevo usuario."

#: includes/class-atshift-upf-admin.php
msgid "Applied when the profile is next saved."
msgstr "Se aplica la próxima vez que se guarda el perfil."

#: includes/class-atshift-upf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Hiding an item does not change its current setting. For supported checkbox "
"features, use the additional option to turn the feature off."
msgstr ""
"Ocultar un elemento no cambia su ajuste actual. Para las funciones de "
"casilla compatibles, usa la opción adicional para desactivar la función."

#: includes/class-atshift-upf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Items with locked checkboxes are managed in Fields. Remove the field before "
"configuring the item here."
msgstr ""
"Los elementos con casillas bloqueadas se gestionan en Campos. Elimina el "
"campo antes de configurar aquí el elemento."

#: includes/class-atshift-upf-admin.php
msgid "Send account email"
msgstr "Enviar correo electrónico de cuenta"

#: includes/class-atshift-upf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Applied only when creating a new user. Existing users keep their saved "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"Solo se aplica al crear un nuevo usuario. Los usuarios existentes conservan "
"el ajuste guardado."

#: includes/class-atshift-upf-profile.php:910
msgid "You are not allowed to assign this role."
msgstr "No tienes permisos para asignar este perfil."
